/-! # Erdos251: theorems derived from what the paper results' proofs use

Each command below rebuilds, as a library theorem the kernel checks, a finding of
the argument graph about a theorem the papers cite. See
`ErdosProblems.ArgumentGraph.Derive` for what each command adds. -/

set_option argumentGraph.strict true
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

derive_idle ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR20.finite_separation_complete
derive_idle ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR20.one_tail_signed_certificate
derive_idle ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.long_joint_prime_gap_countermodel
derive_weakening ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.long_joint_prime_gap_countermodel
derive_frontier ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.long_joint_prime_gap_countermodel
derive_weakening ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.nonconcentration_does_not_force_irrationality
derive_weakening ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.prime_gap_equal_shift_zeroDensity
derive_weakening ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.short_joint_prime_gap_countermodel
derive_frontier ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.short_joint_prime_gap_countermodel
derive_weakening ErdosProblems.Erdos251.irrational_tsum_primeDyadicTerm_iff_primeGap
derive_frontier ErdosProblems.Erdos251.irrational_tsum_primeDyadicTerm_iff_primeGap

-- Derivations the export does not decide in advance: conjuncts a proof may establish
-- without an open hypothesis, and frontiers with the consequences the graph records as
-- proved by corpus theorems discharged. A command that adds nothing warns.
set_option argumentGraph.strict false in derive_conjuncts ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.long_joint_prime_gap_countermodel
set_option argumentGraph.strict false in derive_conjuncts ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.nonconcentration_does_not_force_irrationality
set_option argumentGraph.strict false in derive_conjuncts ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.prime_gap_two_window_sparse
set_option argumentGraph.strict false in derive_conjuncts ErdosProblems.Erdos251.PaperCompleteR21.short_joint_prime_gap_countermodel
set_option argumentGraph.strict false in derive_frontier ErdosProblems.Erdos251.irrational_tsum_primeDyadicTerm_iff_primeGap using ErdosProblems.Erdos251.tsum_primeDyadicTerm_eq_two_add_primeGap_unconditional ErdosProblems.Erdos251.tsum_primeDyadicTerm_eq_two_add_primeGap ErdosProblems.Erdos251.tsum_primeDisplayedDyadicTerm_eq_four_add_two_primeGap
